UPDATE companies SET description='Loeb Electric is headquartered in Columbus, Ohio, with four retail stores in central Ohio (including Hilliard). Founded in 1912 in Columbus by Oscar Avery and Arthur Loeb Sr. as The Avery & Loeb Electric Company, the business paused briefly during the Great Depression before Arthur Loeb restarted it. Ownership has passed through three generations of the Loeb family and remains family‑owned today, led by President Charles Loeb.

The company operates as an independent electrical distributor with four distribution centers, 400,000+ sq. ft. of warehouse space, 35+ delivery trucks, and 350+ team members. It stocks electrical distribution & controls, lighting fixtures & bulbs, wire & conduit, and tools. Value‑added services include vendor‑managed inventory (VMI) with consigned stock options, project material management, wire cutting/harnessing/parallel/coiling and pulling‑head installation, supply kitting, 24/7 locker pickup (Loeb Lockers), same‑day delivery, and after‑hours emergency service. The facility processes over 500 orders — comprising 8,000+ line items — daily.

Loeb serves two primary customer groups: local electrical contractors in central Ohio and national multi‑site brands (retail, commercial) across the United States. Its national accounts division provides preventative and reactive maintenance services for brands with multiple locations, while contractor‑focused solutions such as VMI, kitting, and wire services aim to increase jobsite productivity.

The company emphasizes trust, personal service, and commitment to customer success, as stated by President Charles Loeb. It differentiates through its "Loeb Difference" — combining local presence with national reach, continuous improvement, and innovative programs in sustainable lighting, jobsite productivity, and wire services.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical distribution & controls supply", "Lighting fixtures & bulbs supply", "Wire & conduit supply", "Tool supply", "Will\u2011call order & pick\u2011up counter", "24/7 material pick\u2011up (Loeb Lockers)", "Same\u2011day delivery", "After\u2011hours emergency service", "Vendor\u2011managed inventory (VMI)", "Project material management", "Wire cutting, harnessing, parallel, coiling", "Pulling head installation", "Supply kitting", "Advanced shipping notifications", "Smart locker pickup", "Timely delivery services", "Convenient pickup locations"], "industries": ["Electrical Contractors", "National Multi\u2011site Brands", "Commercial Facilities Maintenance", "Commercial Construction"], "materials": ["Electrical distribution equipment", "Lighting fixtures", "Bulbs", "Wire", "Conduit", "Tools", "Control systems"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same\u2011day delivery available for local orders", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family\u2011owned since 1912, now third generation", "400,000+ sq. ft. warehouse with 8,000+ line items picked daily", "Vendor\u2011managed inventory (VMI) with consigned stock options", "24/7 material pick\u2011up via Loeb Lockers and same\u2011day delivery", "National accounts division serving multi\u2011site brands with preventative/reactive maintenance"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1912 in Columbus by Oscar Avery and Arthur Loeb Sr. -> /about-us", "Family\u2011owned, third generation led by Charles Loeb -> /about-us", "Headquarters Columbus, Ohio -> /about-us", "350+ team members -> /about-us", "4 retail stores central Ohio -> /about-us", "4 distribution centers -> /about-us", "400,000+ sq. ft. warehouse -> /about-us", "35+ delivery trucks -> /about-us", "500+ orders daily, 8,000+ lines daily -> /about-us", "Ranked Top 50 by Electrical Wholesaling -> /about-us", "Electrical distribution & controls, lighting, wire & conduit, tools -> /", "24/7 Loeb Lockers, same\u2011day delivery, after\u2011hours emergency -> /", "VMI services, project material management, wire services, supply kitting -> /services", "Serves electrical contractor community and national account customers -> /about-us", "Preventative and reactive maintenance for national brands -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are an innovative electrical distributor committed to bringing our values to every project, every day.", "founded_year": "1912", "employee_count": "350+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='loeb-electric' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
