UPDATE companies SET description='Magic Solar operates from Boise, Idaho, serving the Treasure Valley and Magic Valley regions including Twin Falls. The company provides solar installation services for commercial, residential, and agricultural customers. While the firm’s exact founding date is not publicly disclosed, its team brings over 40 years of combined industry experience.

