UPDATE companies SET description='Manufacture Alabama operates from Montgomery as the state''s sole trade association focused exclusively on the legislative, regulatory, and operational concerns of manufacturers and their partner businesses. The organization represents hundreds of companies ranging from global corporations to small family-owned operations, each described as a vital component of Alabama''s economy and job base. No founding year or founder names are publicly disclosed.

The association provides a suite of services designed to support vibrant manufacturing operations, including environmental, safety, and human resources compliance assistance; government and regulatory representation; workforce development strategies; transportation and infrastructure initiatives; industry promotion; and tax, energy, and other policy support. A staff of five leads these efforts, headed by President & CEO Jon Barganier, alongside specialists in government affairs, workforce development, communications, and an affiliated executive director role.

Membership is divided into two categories: Manufacturing Members and Partner Members. Programs such as Girls Learning About Manufacturing (GLAM) aim to cultivate future talent by creating interest in manufacturing careers among female students entering the workforce.

Manufacture Alabama states its mission as creating a business and political climate that promotes a positive, competitive environment and enhances growth opportunities for Alabama manufacturers.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Environmental compliance assistance", "Safety compliance assistance", "Human resources compliance assistance", "Government and regulatory representation", "Workforce development strategies", "Transportation and infrastructure initiatives", "Industry promotion", "Tax policy support", "Energy policy support"], "industries": ["Manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only trade association in Alabama dedicated exclusively to manufacturers'' competitive, legislative, regulatory, and operational interests", "Represents hundreds of companies from international corporations to small family-owned operations", "Provides direct government and regulatory representation in Montgomery", "Offers workforce development programs including GLAM for female students", "Covers environmental, safety, HR compliance, transportation, tax, and energy policy support"], "facts_used": ["Name: Manufacture Alabama -> db", "Headquarters: Montgomery, Alabama -> db", "Description: Only trade association in Alabama dedicated exclusively to manufacturers'' interests -> /", "Represents hundreds of companies from international corporations to small family-owned operations -> /", "Services: Environmental, safety, HR compliance; government representation; workforce development; transportation/infrastructure; industry promotion; tax/energy policy support -> /about", "Staff: Jon Barganier (President & CEO), George Clark (Director Emeritus & President of Workforce Development), Schuyler Espy (APPCO Executive Director), Parker Harris (Director of Government Affairs & Advocacy), Amanda Salazar (VP Communications & Membership) -> /", "Member categories: Manufacturing Members and Partner 