UPDATE companies SET description='Marine Tech Wire & Cable Inc operates from York, Pennsylvania, where it produces multiconductor cables at its domestic plant. The company serves demanding environments including naval vessels, commercial shipping, and offshore oil platforms.

The product line spans commercial and navy shipboard cables, high-temperature lead wire, and low-smoke zero-halogen variants engineered for seawater exposure and extreme heat. Capabilities include custom cable design and toll processing, supported by an application engineering team that assists with Mil-Spec and part-number searches.

Primary markets are defense maritime, commercial marine, oil and gas drilling, and general industrial sectors requiring reliable performance in harsh conditions. The company''s resource library provides technical specifications and data sheets for each product family.

Marine Tech emphasizes U.S. manufacturing at its York facility and was recognized as the 22nd fastest-growing company in the Central Pennsylvania region on the sixteenth annual Top 50 list. Its differentiators include domestic production, engineering support, and a searchable Mil-Spec database.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable design", "Toll processing", "Multiconductor cable manufacturing", "Commercial shipboard cable manufacturing", "Navy shipboard cable manufacturing", "High temperature lead wire manufacturing", "Low smoke zero halogen cable manufacturing", "Mil-Spec and part number search", "Application engineering support", "Technical resource library"], "industries": ["Defense / naval", "Commercial maritime", "Oil and gas", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Manufactured in the USA at York, PA plant", "Application engineering team for product selection", "Searchable Mil-Spec and part-number database", "Ranked 22nd in Central PA Top 50 Fastest-Growing Companies", "Custom cable design and toll processing services"], "facts_used": ["Location: York, PA -> db, /", "Manufactures multiconductor cables for ships, oil platforms, industrial -> /", "Engineered for harsh environments (sea water, high temps) -> /", "Product lines: Commercial Shipboard, Navy Shipboard, High Temp Lead Wire, Low Smoke Zero Halogen -> /", "Ranked 22nd in Top 50 Fastest-Growing Companies (Central PA) -> /", "Cables manufactured in USA at York, PA plant -> /", "Application engineers help identify right product -> /", "Search by Mil-Spec or Part Number -> /", "UL Listed certification -> db", "Custom cable design and toll processing capabilities -> db", "Resource library with technical specs/data sheets -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Marine Tech Wire and Cable manufactures multiconductor cables used in ships, oil drill