e, electrical wiring, thermocouples, diaphragms -> /", "Offers streamlined procurement, faster service, single access point -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We''re part of Marsh Bellofram, a U.S. manufacturer with a history reaching back more than 125 years. Our companies have always engineered, manufactured, and customized critical parts for the medical device industry.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='marsh-medical' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Martin Steel Design Co LLC operates from Waipahu, Hawaii, and was established in 2000. The company traces its roots to a family trade in ornamental metalwork that began in the 1970s. Owner and Responsible Managing Employee Larry brought over 32 years of experience, having learned the craft from family mentors in the late 1980s. Jo, who grew up in the same trade, joined as project designer and manager, steering the firm’s creative direction with modern accents.

Services span conceptual design, custom layout, finishing, and professional installation. While metals are the primary medium, the team also integrates glass, wood, and bamboo into projects. The operation emphasizes a quality-over-quantity approach, handling projects of varying scale without disclosing facility size or annual volume.

Clients include architects, designers, engineers, and developers across residential and commercial sectors in Hawaii. The company has built long-term relationships with contractors and end-users alike, collaborating on projects ranging from private sanctuaries to larger developments.

