UPDATE companies SET description='McLure Packaging Systems & Supplies operates from Essex Junction, Vermont, where it has served industrial customers across New England for over 15 years. The company positions itself as a local partner for businesses of all sizes, from small backyard operations to larger manufacturers.

The firm specializes in custom packaging design, supply chain management, and inventory services. McLure manages safety stock programs, offers just-in-time and interactive stock management, and provides consulting on an hourly or project basis.

Its customer base consists of industrial companies in New England that are often too small to work directly with manufacturers. McLure acts as the local representative for its fabrication partners, handling design, quality control, and delivery so clients can reduce on-site storage space and handling costs.

