ensor", "Large-scale pellet-fed 3D printers", "Posi-Melt screw series", "MDP Performance Non-Return Valve", "Mini-Shut Automatic Shut-Off Nozzle", "Posi-Shut Automatic Shut-Off Valve", "High Performance Plasticating Barrels"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Nine awarded patents covering plasticating components, injection units, 3D printers, and melt monitoring systems", "Proprietary design software that calculates exact heat transfer, shear rates, and pressure profiles", "Real-time melt monitoring and predictive analytics via Melt-IQ and Melt-Profiler II systems", "Custom engineering tailored to specific resin and process requirements", "Trusted by industry leaders including Absolute Haitian, Engel, Milacron, and Windsor"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1999 by Mike Durina -> db", "Headquarters in Columbiana, Ohio -> db", "ISO9001 certification -> db", "Nine awarded patents including plasticating components, injection units, 3D printers, melt monitoring systems -> /about", "Proprietary design software calculates heat transfer, shear rates, pressure profiles -> /about", "Products: Posi-Melt screws, MDP non-return valves, Mini-Shut nozzles, plasticating barrels, Inject-EX systems, Melt-IQ, Melt-Profiler II, Temp-Sense -> /, /about", "Industries served: automotive, medical devices, consumer electronics, additive manufacturing, plastic processing, OEM, custom molding -> /, /about", "Customer references: Absolute Haitian, Engel, Milacron, Windsor -> /", "Mission: help injection, extrusion, blow molding, 3D printing companies be more profitable -> /about", "Materials: PE, PP, PVC, ABS, PC, PET, engineering plastics, hygroscopic ionomers -> /", "Installation and training services offered -> /", "Retrofit integration with existing equipment -> /", "Purging compounds distributed: Barrel Blitz, Poly Clear Prime -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Advanced manufacturing of injection molding screws, ext