Mercury states that its founding mission was to simplify customers'' lives by consolidating multiple processes under one roof. It emphasizes a zero-defects goal backed by stringent quality control and highlights its leadership in guiding clients toward environmentally responsible materials such as recycled and reprocessed plastics. Long-term partnerships built on integrity and responsiveness remain central to its business model.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thermoforming", "Plastic fabrication", "Printing services", "Engineering and design", "Mill operations", "In-house sheet extrusion", "Custom printing", "Recycled/reprocessed material processing"], "industries": ["Food Packaging", "Retail and point of sale", "Consumer Packaging", "Automotive", "Healthcare and medical devices"], "materials": ["Recycled plastics", "Reprocessed plastics", "Blended plastic materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All core capabilities \u2014 engineering, mill operations, sheet extrusion, printing \u2014 housed in a single facility network", "Zero-defects quality target with continuous improvement focus", "Environmental material expertise including recycled, reprocessed, and blended plastics", "Four manufacturing sites and two warehouses totaling 500,000+ square feet"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1955 -> /about", "Headquarters Chicago, Illinois -> db", "Four manufacturing sites, two warehouses, 500k+ sq ft -> /", "Capabilities: thermoforming, plastic fabrication, printing, engineering & design, mill operations, in-house sheet extrusion, custom printing -> /", "Industries served: Food Packaging, retail and point of sale, Consumer Packaging, Automotive, Healthcare and medical devices -> /", "Environmental responsibility: recycled, reprocessed, blended plastic materials -> /", "Mission: simplify customers'' lives, zero defects goal, value relationships -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_prod